cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Pyramidal Deformable Convolution: code and results"
abstract: >-
  The Pyramidal Deformable Convolution (PDC) block, which extends deformable
  convolution with a learned depth offset along a feature pyramid, together
  with the training runners, analysis scripts, per-run results and per-image
  metrics of its evaluation on six classification and segmentation benchmarks.
